    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As the population of Pakistan grows older, nearly nine per cent is 55 years of age or above, the need to properly address the healthcare needs of the elderly is taking on added importance. Poverty, large families, and a general lack of awareness are increasingly compromising the quality of life for the country's elderly population.",
